#: src/postulo/plugins/maps/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Maps"
msgstr "Kartes"

#: src/postulo/plugins/maps/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Show where the companies are on a map, placing each postal address offline at its postcode or its town from tables kept on this server, or where you put it by hand; a contact's address and your own are drawn only when you ask, and their points are kept with them and erased with them. The map is drawn by Leaflet (BSD-2-Clause) over OpenStreetMap's tiles (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL) unless Settings chooses other tiles or none; OpenStreetMap then learns each viewer's address and the area they look at. Places come from GeoNames (CC BY 3.0; its postal codes CC BY 4.0), the country names from the Unicode CLDR through Babel, and the world outline from Natural Earth (public domain). Switched off, there is no map page and no address is placed; the coordinates already stored stay recorded and come back untouched when it is switched on again."
msgstr "Rādīt, kur uzņēmumi ir kartē, novietojot katru pasta adresi bezsaistē savā pasta kodā vai pilsētā no tabulām, kas glabājas uz šī servera, vai kur jūs nodot to ar roku; kontakta adrese un jūsu pašu tiek zīmēts tikai tad, kad jūs lūgt, un to punkti tiek saglabāti ar viņiem un dzēsti ar tiem. Karte ir zīmēta ar lietošanas instrukciju (BSD-2-Clause) OpenStreetMap kauliņiem (© OpenStreetMap veidotāji, ODbL), izņemot gadījumus, kad iestatījumi izvēlas citus kauliņus vai nevienu; OpenStreetMap pēc tam uzzina katra skatītāja adresi un apgabalu, uz kuru tie skatās. Vietas ir no GeoNames (CC BY 3.0; tās pasta kodi CC BY 4.0), valstu nosaukumi no Unicode CLDR caur Bābeli, un pasaules kontūra no Natural Earth (publiskais īpašums). Izslēgts, nav kartes lapas un nav novietota adrese; koordinātas, kas jau saglabātas, paliek ierakstītas un atgriežas neskartas, kad tā atkal ir ieslēgta."
